## 1. Entry Points

Three Owner-facing commands. Nothing else reaches the company.

| Command | When |
|---|---|
| `/goal` | Set, update, or extend a mission |
| `/submission` | Add a requirement under the active goal |
| `/hot-fix` | Emergency fix under the active goal |

`/ceo`, `/cto`, `/cqo`, `/coo`, `/cdo`, `/ops`, `/hiring` are not slash commands.
Internal routing uses agent/skill wiring only.

